WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
The crouching-medium confirm starts with one Sun Crest visible.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.750
Heavy Sun Rise leaves Ingrid airborne before the delayed medium-punch pickup.

3
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.750
After the airborne medium punch, Ingrid lands and uses the one-Crest OD Sun Flare.

4
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.850
The forward Vanishing Sun kick catches the airborne Ryu.

5
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.200
Light Sun Flare stores a Crest after the knockdown.
